{"seq":1,"slug":"backpressure-fundamentals","title":"背压的基本原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/backpressure-and-flow-control/backpressure-fundamentals","wordCount":1877,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"背压的基本原理\">背压的基本原理</h1><p>绝大多数线上系统不是被&quot;流量太高&quot;打垮的，而是被&quot;流量到达的速度超过它能安全处理的速度&quot;打垮的——这正是 <a href=\"https://dzone.com/articles/backpressure-in-distributed-systems\">DZone 在《Backpressure in Distributed Systems》</a> 中反复强调的一句话：背压不是优化项，而是分布式系统的正确性要求。当一个快生产者持续向一个慢消费者灌数据，中间的缓冲会无界增长，内存被吃光，进程 OOM，整条链路雪崩。背压就是为了在这条因果链的源头按下刹车：让消费者把&quot;我还能吃多少&quot;这个信号反向传回给生产者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>背压（backpressure）的本质是一个<strong>反向的容量信号</strong>：数据正向地从生产者流向消费者，而&quot;我处理不过来了&quot;这个信号逆着数据流方向回传。它与限流（rate limiting）有一个关键区别——限流是<strong>主动</strong>地按一个预设上限切顶（比如每秒最多 1000 QPS），而背压是<strong>被动地对真实消费能力做实时反应</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/back-pressure-in-distributed-systems/\">GeeksforGeeks</a>、<a href=\"https://layrs.me/course/hld/08-asynchronous-processing/back-pressure/\">Layrs HLD 课程</a> 均如此对比）。限流不知道下游此刻是否真的忙；背压知道，因为它的信号源就是下游本身。</p>\n<p>最经典、也最容易被忽视的背压实现其实就在 TCP 里。TCP 的滑动窗口流量控制保证发送方的速率不超过接收方能承受的速率：当接收窗口（receive window）满了，发送方就被阻塞——<a href=\"https://medium.com/@drewjaja/5-ways-of-handling-backpressure-in-distributed-systems-09517ed6eadc\">多篇资料</a> 称之为&quot;烤进协议里的背压&quot;。理解了 TCP 这个例子，背压就不再是个抽象名词，而是一个你每天都在依赖的物理事实。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[生产者&lt;br/&gt;fast producer] --&gt;|正向数据流| B[缓冲区 / 队列&lt;br/&gt;有界容量]&#10;  B --&gt;|正向数据流| C[消费者&lt;br/&gt;slow consumer]&#10;  C -.-&gt;|反向容量信号&lt;br/&gt;request n / 窗口大小| B&#10;  B -.-&gt;|缓冲将满&lt;br/&gt;阻塞或丢弃| P&#10;  C -.-&gt;|drain / ack| P\">flowchart TD\n  P[生产者&lt;br/&gt;fast producer] --&gt;|正向数据流| B[缓冲区 / 队列&lt;br/&gt;有界容量]\n  B --&gt;|正向数据流| C[消费者&lt;br/&gt;slow consumer]\n  C -.-&gt;|反向容量信号&lt;br/&gt;request n / 窗口大小| B\n  B -.-&gt;|缓冲将满&lt;br/&gt;阻塞或丢弃| P\n  C -.-&gt;|drain / ack| P</pre><p>下表把几种相邻概念放在一起对比，帮助区分&quot;背压&quot;到底特殊在哪：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>触发依据</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>典型副作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>背压 backpressure</td>\n<td>下游真实消费能力</td>\n<td>消费者 → 生产者</td>\n<td>生产者被阻塞/降速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流 rate limiting</td>\n<td>预设固定阈值</td>\n<td>入口拦截</td>\n<td>超额请求被拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载脱落 load shedding</td>\n<td>系统饱和度</td>\n<td>入口主动丢弃</td>\n<td>部分请求被丢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓冲 buffering</td>\n<td>瞬时突发</td>\n<td>中间吸收</td>\n<td>延迟上升、内存占用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"用-little-定律量化-为什么会失控\">用 Little 定律量化&quot;为什么会失控&quot;</h2><p>背压为什么是正确性问题而非性能问题，可以用排队论里的 Little 定律说清楚。<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/rponte/8489a7acf95a3ba61b6d012fd5b90ed3\">rponte 整理的这篇笔记</a> 正是用 Little 定律来论证何时该施加背压。Little 定律说：稳态下系统里平均驻留的请求数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，等于到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 乘以平均驻留时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在于一个稳定系统必须满足到达率不超过服务率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\le \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>。一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda &gt; \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，队列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 不会收敛到某个稳定值，而是<strong>随时间线性增长</strong>——这就是无界缓冲的数学本质。设队列在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的长度为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(t) = L_0 + (\\lambda - \\mu)\\, t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda - \\mu &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 终将撑爆任何有限内存。背压做的事，就是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 强行拉回到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>：当下游 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 下降（比如 GC、慢查询、依赖抖动）时，信号回传让上游的有效 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 同步下降。换句话说，背压是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 跟随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 的负反馈环，而不是放任两者脱钩。</p>\n<p>这也解释了为什么&quot;加大缓冲区&quot;几乎从来不是解法：缓冲只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 抬高，推迟崩溃的时刻，却改变不了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda &gt; \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 这个根本不等式。缓冲能吸收<strong>瞬时突发</strong>（短时间的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 尖峰，事后会回落），但吸收不了<strong>持续过载</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推-拉与需求信号\">推、拉与需求信号</h2><p>实现背压有两种根本姿态：推（push）和拉（pull）。纯推模型里生产者想发就发，消费者只能被动接收，天然没有背压；纯拉模型里消费者主动来取，生产者无人催就不发，天然有背压但可能浪费往返。现代方案大多是<strong>带需求信号的混合模型</strong>。</p>\n<p>Reactive Streams 规范把这件事标准化了。按规范，订阅者（Subscriber）必须通过 <code>Subscription.request(long n)</code> 显式声明自己愿意接收多少个元素，发布者收到这个 demand 之前不得发送 <code>onNext</code>——<a href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/\">Reactive Streams 规范</a> 把&quot;决定何时、接收多少&quot;的责任明确交给了订阅者。这是一种<strong>异步、非阻塞的背压</strong>：消费者不必阻塞线程去等待，而是用一个数字 <code>n</code> 告诉上游&quot;再给我 n 个&quot;。RxJava 的 <code>Flowable</code>、Project Reactor、Akka Streams 都是这套 <code>request(n)</code> 协议的实现（见 <a href=\"https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/wiki/Backpressure\">RxJava Wiki</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Reactive Streams 风格的需求信号：消费者按自己的节奏拉取&#10;subscription.request(8);            // 我现在只要 8 个&#10;// ... 处理完这 8 个之后 ...&#10;subscription.request(8);            // 准备好了，再要 8 个&#10;// 生产者在收到 request 之前不得 emit，缓冲自然有界\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Reactive Streams 风格的需求信号：消费者按自己的节奏拉取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">subscription.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 我现在只要 8 个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ... 处理完这 8 个之后 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">subscription.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 准备好了，再要 8 个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 生产者在收到 request 之前不得 emit，缓冲自然有界</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[订阅者 Subscriber] --&gt;|request n| Pub[发布者 Publisher]&#10;  Pub --&gt;|onNext x n| S&#10;  S --&gt;|处理完毕再 request| Pub&#10;  Pub -.-&gt;|无 demand 时&lt;br/&gt;暂停 emit| Pub\">flowchart TD\n  S[订阅者 Subscriber] --&gt;|request n| Pub[发布者 Publisher]\n  Pub --&gt;|onNext x n| S\n  S --&gt;|处理完毕再 request| Pub\n  Pub -.-&gt;|无 demand 时&lt;br/&gt;暂停 emit| Pub</pre><h2 id=\"缓冲-丢弃与限速-三种过载策略\">缓冲、丢弃与限速：三种过载策略</h2><p>当背压信号触发后，系统具体怎么应对？<a href=\"https://www.conduktor.io/glossary/backpressure-handling-in-streaming-systems\">Conduktor 的整理</a> 与 <a href=\"https://softwarepatternslexicon.com/java/reactive-programming/backpressure-strategies/\">Software Patterns Lexicon</a> 归纳出三类核心策略，没有银弹，取舍取决于业务对&quot;每条数据是否必须处理&quot;的要求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>缓冲（buffer）</strong>：像蓄水池一样暂存溢出的数据，等消费者赶上来。适用于&quot;每条都不能丢&quot;的场景（如订单处理），且突发是短暂的、消费者终会追平。代价是缓冲必须<strong>有界</strong>——无界缓冲等于把 OOM 推迟到流量稍大一点的那天。</li>\n<li><strong>丢弃（drop）</strong>：消费不过来就扔。<code>dropHead</code> 扔最旧的、<code>dropLatest</code> 扔最新的。适用于&quot;新鲜度比完整性更重要&quot;的场景（如实时指标、行情快照），保住响应性比保住每一条更值。</li>\n<li><strong>限速 / 节流（throttle）</strong>：直接压低生产者速率去匹配消费者。适用于源头可被反向施压、且不希望丢数据的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选型可以用一句话概括：当突发可预期且消费者会追平、每条都重要时用有界 buffer；当响应性比完整性重要时用 drop 或 throttle。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个具体例子-node-js-流的背压\">一个具体例子：Node.js 流的背压</h2><p>把上面的理论落到一个你能立刻验证的实现上。<a href=\"https://nodejs.org/learn/modules/backpressuring-in-streams\">Node.js 官方文档《Backpressuring in Streams》</a> 描述了一个教科书式的背压闭环：当可写流内部缓冲超过 <code>highWaterMark</code>（默认 16KB / 64KB，取决于流类型）或写队列繁忙时，<code>.write()</code> 会返回 <code>false</code>。这个 <code>false</code> 就是背压信号——它告诉调用方&quot;别再写了&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const ok = writable.write(chunk);&#10;if (!ok) {&#10;  readable.pause(); // 收到背压：暂停上游读取&#10;  writable.once(&#39;drain&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    // 缓冲排空后触发 drain&#10;    readable.resume(); // 恢复上游读取&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const ok = writable.write(chunk);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (!ok) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  readable.pause(); // 收到背压：暂停上游读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  writable.once('drain', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 缓冲排空后触发 drain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    readable.resume(); // 恢复上游读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>readable.pause()</code> 把 <code>readableFlowing</code> 设为 <code>false</code>，停掉 <code>data</code> 事件；待缓冲排空、<code>drain</code> 事件触发后再 <code>resume()</code>。这正是 TCP 滑动窗口在应用层的翻版。<a href=\"https://frontendmasters.com/blog/your-node-js-streams-arent-backpressuring-theyre-silently-eating-your-memory/\">Frontend Masters 的这篇文章</a> 警告：如果你忽略 <code>.write()</code> 的返回值、一味地写，流就<strong>不会背压</strong>，缓冲会悄悄吃光内存——这恰好对应前面 Little 定律里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda &gt; \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 线性增长的那条曲线。值得一提的是，用 <code>pipe()</code> 或 <code>pipeline()</code> 时这套 pause/resume/drain 是自动接好的，手写 <code>write</code> 循环才需要自己处理——这也是优先用 <code>pipeline()</code> 的理由之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>背压是<strong>逆数据流方向回传的容量信号</strong>，让生产者据消费者真实能力降速；它与&quot;按固定阈值切顶&quot;的限流本质不同。</li>\n<li>TCP 滑动窗口是背压最普及的实现，理解它能把背压从抽象名词变成物理事实。</li>\n<li>用 Little 定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 看清根本：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda &gt; \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，队列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 就线性增长，无界缓冲必崩；背压是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 拉回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 的负反馈环。</li>\n<li>加大缓冲只抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、推迟崩溃，吸收得了瞬时突发，吸收不了持续过载。</li>\n<li>Reactive Streams 用 <code>request(n)</code> 把&quot;要多少&quot;的决定权交给消费者，实现异步非阻塞背压。</li>\n<li>三类过载策略——buffer / drop / throttle——按&quot;每条是否必须处理&quot;取舍；buffer 必须有界。</li>\n<li>Node.js 流用 <code>.write()</code> 返回 <code>false</code> + <code>pause</code>/<code>drain</code>/<code>resume</code> 演示了一个可亲手验证的完整背压闭环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"背压的基本原理","id":"背压的基本原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用 Little 定律量化\"为什么会失控\"","id":"用-little-定律量化-为什么会失控"},{"level":2,"text":"推、拉与需求信号","id":"推-拉与需求信号"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲、丢弃与限速：三种过载策略","id":"缓冲-丢弃与限速-三种过载策略"},{"level":2,"text":"一个具体例子：Node.js 流的背压","id":"一个具体例子-node-js-流的背压"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"特性开关与负载卸载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/graceful-degradation-and-fault-tolerance/feature-flags-and-load-shedding"},"next":{"title":"队列与缓冲管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/backpressure-and-flow-control/queue-and-buffer-management"}}